['Model','XGBoost on 32 inputs known before launch; trained on 43,904 launches of 2023–24; tested on 26,533 launches of 2025 and 12,990 of January–June 2026'],
['Quality','AUC within category 0.859 (2025) and 0.866 (Jan–Jun 2026); accuracy 0.849 against 0.708 for "always funded"'],
['Key finding','Our data holds about 85% of all funded campaigns but about 42% of the failed ones'],
['Business result','In a test on 2025 campaigns re-weighted to Kickstarter\'s official mix, a coach who sees the riskiest 30% reached 51% of all failures (maximum possible 54%), and about 95% of that group failed. Per 100 campaigns: about 29 failing teams found, against 27 with a one-page scorecard and 25 with the best category rule. A new cohort may differ'],
