tb([['Method','Type','Used for'],['Decision tree, logistic regression, random forest, XGBoost','Class','Core models and comparison'],['GridSearchCV with time-ordered cross-validation','Class','Tuning'],['TF-IDF + logistic regression','Class (text mining)','Text score'],['Linear regression; k-means','Class','Tested, not used in the app'],['AUC, accuracy, precision, recall, F1, confusion matrix','Class','Evaluation'],['Monotone goal rule','Beyond class','Sensible goal advice'],['Platt calibration','Beyond class','Probabilities that match observed rates'],['Prior shift to official rates','Beyond class','Correcting the too-optimistic level'],['SHAP','Beyond class','Reasons per campaign, area scores'],['Nearest neighbours','Beyond class','Similar campaigns'],['LightGBM + Optuna','Beyond class','Comparison only']],[72,36,62])

h1('13. Mistakes made during the work, and corrections')
b(['First merge: "no video" written where the field was absent; subcategory copied into the main category. Rebuilt as merge_v2.','Semantic layer v1.2 briefly stated coverage as 90% / 43% because it included 2026; corrected to 85% / 42% (campaigns ended before 01.01.2026, the date of the official figures).','The title-capitalisation input distorted the Pitch score; dropped and the model retrained (33 → 32 inputs).','After that retraining the single check-up threshold drifted to 11.6%; it was fixed at the approved 11.5%.','The landing-page numbers first requested (422,000 collected, 96%) were outdated; the final ones (489,000 and 95%) were used and this was reported.','The font of the redesign did not load on the live site at first; fixed and verified live.','Slide 8 of the deck first had bars starting at 0.4, which exaggerated differences; now they start at 0.','The app pictures in the deck (slides 4 and 12) are the app code rendered in the work session, not captures of the live site.','On 25.11 the round-number flag was recomputed for every goal the app tested, which let a suggested goal win only because it was round; corrected on 26.11 (section 10.5).','Slide 10 first compared the model only with rules that look at the category, which overstated its lead (29 vs 25); since 26.11 it also shows a one-page scorecard (27).'])

h1('14. Who decided what')
p('Claude did the data work, code, analysis, app, deck and drafts. Fedor took the decisions at each checkpoint, among them: rebuild the merge; use video and pre-launch page only in the recent-years model and demand the leak test; AUC within category as headline metric; drop the weak inputs; keep founder history in the model but never show its raw percentages; XGBoost as final model with the goal rule; the verdict rule (Adjust at 5 points, Coach first below 11.5%) and coaching slots by rank at 30% capacity, separated on 25.11 after the second review; show the text score as product type, not as a lever; cut archetypes; public repository without raw data; similar campaigns without creator names; the redesign and its safeguards; the official-mix business claim instead of the 76% figure from our data. All AI use is recorded in <font name="BB">docs/ai_use_log.md</font>.')

h1('15. Limits')
b(['The coaching test shows who gets flagged, not how much coaching helps; that would need a study with real coaches.','The text score is fitted with shuffled folds before the time-ordered tuning, so tuning folds can borrow later labels. The final test on 2025 and 2026 is not affected, but the tuning is not fully time-clean.','The remaining selection bias cannot be measured; quality figures are "in our data".','Official rates used for the correction are all-time averages per main category, not per year or subcategory.','Everything is association in past campaigns. The app does not prove that a change causes a better result.','Earlier failed campaigns of a founder are under-recorded, so track records look better than they are.','The model predicts reaching the goal on Kickstarter. It does not judge the business idea or whether the company survives.','Data ends in 2026; platform rules and behaviour change over time, so the model would need retraining.','Not done: a test with a real cohort of teams; following live campaigns daily to record hidden failures; other platforms.'])

